DETAIL:  Failing row contains (28068aea-a573-4309-84c6-7c47379f316e, e97af6fc-089d-4508-ad3a-5d2009402324, 1, 2026-02-01, null, 0.000000, 70.000000, 0.000000, 70.000000, 2.0000, 30.000000, 1, DRILL-B4, 2026-11-10 21:11:34.714419+08, 2026-11-10 21:11:34.714419+08, null, null, null).
  → 卡明细插入成功（标准用量 1.1 × 12.00 = 13.20）
